POST /auth/login <p>Description: Authenticate credentials and acquire a temporary Bearer JWT token. Headers: <code>Content-Type: application/json</code></p> <p>=== "API Key Request"     <pre><code>{
  "api_key": "default_insecure_admin_key"
}
</code></pre></p> <p>=== "Username &amp; Password Request"     <pre><code>{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "default_insecure_admin_key"
}
</code></pre></p> <p>Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
  "expires_in": 86400
}
</code></pre></p> GET /health <p>Description: Fast liveness probe for load balancers and watchdog scripts. Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "status": "ok",
  "uptime": 142
}
</code></pre></p> GET /server/stats <p>Description: Live server performance metrics, tick rates, connected player counts, and memory footprint. Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "server_fps": 60.0,
  "current_players": 4,
  "max_players": 32,
  "uptime_seconds": 3600,
  "server_name": "My Palworld Server",
  "version": "v0.4.1"
}
</code></pre></p> GET /metrics &amp; GET /v1/api/metrics <p>Description: Prometheus-compatible plaintext metrics for Grafana monitoring. Response <code>200 OK</code>: <code>text/plain</code> Prometheus metric stream.</p> GET /config &amp; POST /config/reload <p>Description: Inspect current runtime settings or trigger hot-reloading of <code>PalSupervisor.json</code> without server restart. Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Configuration reloaded"
}
</code></pre></p>

GET /api/events/stream &amp; GET /events/stream <p>Description: Persistent HTTP event stream (<code>text/event-stream</code>) keeping external panels synced in real time without polling. Headers: <code>Accept: text/event-stream</code>, <code>X-API-Key: ...</code></p> <p>Event Stream Output Example: <pre><code>event: player_join
data: {"player_name":"Ash","player_uid":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","steam_id":"76561198000000000"}

event: janitor_sweep
data: {"drops_cleared":14,"save_triggered":true,"wild_builds_cleared":2}

event: weather_change
data: {"preset":"Thunderstorm"}

event: anti_cheat_violation
data: {"player":"CheaterGuy","rule":"SpeedHack","action":"kicked"}
</code></pre></p>

GET /players <p>Description: Retrieve real-time list of all currently connected players with live HP, SP, location, ping, and IP. Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "count": 1,
  "players": [
    {
      "name": "PalTrainer",
      "player_uid": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "steam_id": "76561198000000000",
      "ip": "192.168.1.100",
      "ping": 25.4,
      "level": 45,
      "hp": 2400.0,
      "max_hp": 2400.0,
      "sp": 500.0,
      "max_sp": 500.0,
      "location": { "x": 12450.0, "y": -45210.0, "z": 320.0 },
      "is_admin": false
    }
  ]
}
</code></pre></p> GET /api/players/all &amp; GET /players/all <p>Description: Comprehensive scan of both online players and saved offline players extracted from <code>UPalGroupManager</code>. Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "count": 2,
  "players": [
    { "name": "OnlineUser", "player_uid": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001", "is_online": true },
    { "name": "OfflineUser", "player_uid": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002", "is_online": false, "level": 30 }
  ]
}
</code></pre></p> GET /players/:player_id <p>Description: Fetch single player details by UID or player name (works online and offline). Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "name": "PalTrainer",
  "player_uid": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "level": 45,
  "exp": 1250400,
  "unused_status_points": 5,
  "location": { "x": 12450.0, "y": -45210.0, "z": 320.0 },
  "is_online": true
}
</code></pre></p> GET /players/:player_id/position <p>Description: Current 3D coordinates and recent breadcrumb position history (last 30 telemetry samples). Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "current": { "x": 12450.0, "y": -45210.0, "z": 320.0 },
  "history": [
    { "x": 12440.0, "y": -45200.0, "z": 320.0, "timestamp": 1725638400 }
  ]
}
</code></pre></p> GET /players/:player_id/inventory <p>Description: Live deep-inspection of all inventory containers, equipped armor, weapons, accessories, and durability. Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "uid": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "count": 2,
  "items": [
    {
      "container": "Common",
      "slot": 0,
      "item_id": "Sphere_Master",
      "count": 50,
      "durability": 0.0,
      "max_durability": 0.0
    },
    {
      "container": "Weapon",
      "slot": 0,
      "item_id": "AssaultRifle_Default_4",
      "count": 1,
      "durability": 2500.0,
      "max_durability": 2500.0
    }
  ]
}
</code></pre></p> GET /api/player/:uid/pals &amp; GET /player/:uid/pals <p>Description: Inspect all Pals currently in the player's active party (IVs, gender, passives, level, rank). Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "uid": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "pals": [
    {
      "slot": 1,
      "character_id": "Anubis",
      "nickname": "GodOfWar",
      "gender": "Male",
      "level": 55,
      "rank": 4,
      "talent_hp": 100,
      "talent_melee": 100,
      "talent_shot": 100,
      "talent_defense": 100,
      "passive_skills": [
        "Legend",
        "Musclehead",
        "Ferocious",
        "BurlyBody"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</code></pre></p>

POST /admin/kick <p>Request Body: <code>{"player": "PalTrainer", "reason": "Disruptive behavior"}</code> Response <code>200 OK</code>: <code>{"success": true, "message": "Player kicked"}</code></p> POST /admin/ban &amp; POST /admin/unban <p>=== "Ban Request"     <pre><code>{
  "player": "PalTrainer",
  "reason": "Speedhacking",
  "ip_ban": true
}
</code></pre> === "Unban Request"     <pre><code>{
  "steam_id": "76561198000000000"
}
</code></pre> Response <code>200 OK</code>: <code>{"success": true, "message": "Player banned/unbanned"}</code></p> GET /bans <p>Description: List all active Steam ID and IP address bans. Response <code>200 OK</code>: JSON list of ban records.</p> POST /admin/freeze &amp; POST /admin/unfreeze <p>Description: Disables or enables player movement, rotation, weapon firing, and sphere throwing. Request Body: <code>{"player": "PalTrainer"}</code> Response <code>200 OK</code>: <code>{"success": true, "message": "Player frozen/unfrozen"}</code></p> POST /admin/mute &amp; POST /admin/unmute <p>Description: Mutes or unmutes a player from in-game chat. Request Body: <code>{"player": "PalTrainer"}</code> Response <code>200 OK</code>: <code>{"success": true, "message": "Player muted/unmuted"}</code></p> POST /admin/godmode <p>Description: Toggles invulnerability to damage, temperature hazards, and hunger depletion. Request Body: <code>{"player": "PalTrainer", "enabled": true}</code> Response <code>200 OK</code>: <code>{"success": true, "godmode": true}</code></p> POST /admin/teleport <p>=== "By Coordinates"     <pre><code>{
  "player": "PalTrainer",
  "x": 10500.0,
  "y": -25000.0,
  "z": 150.0
}
</code></pre> === "To Another Player"     <pre><code>{
  "player": "PalTrainer",
  "target": "AdminBob"
}
</code></pre> Response <code>200 OK</code>: <code>{"success": true, "message": "Teleported"}</code></p> POST /admin/heal &amp; POST /admin/sethp &amp; POST /admin/setsp <p>Description: Set or restore target player HP and SP. Request Body: <code>{"player": "PalTrainer", "hp": 5000}</code> Response <code>200 OK</code>: <code>{"success": true}</code></p>

GET /api/guilds &amp; GET /guilds <p>Description: Returns all server guilds with leader details, member counts, and base counts. Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "count": 1,
  "guilds": [
    {
      "guild_id": "A1B2C3D4-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "guild_name": "ApexPredators",
      "master_uid": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "master_name": "PalTrainer",
      "member_count": 3,
      "base_count": 2
    }
  ]
}
</code></pre></p> GET /api/guilds/:id &amp; GET /guilds/:id <p>Description: Full roster, online status, coordinates, and base camp locations for a specific guild.</p> Guild Management Endpoints <ul> <li><code>POST /api/guilds/:id/kick</code> — <code>{"player_uid": "..."}</code></li> <li><code>POST /api/guilds/:id/transfer_master</code> — <code>{"new_master_uid": "..."}</code></li> <li><code>POST /api/guilds/:id/rename</code> — <code>{"new_name": "NewGuildName"}</code></li> <li><code>POST /api/guilds/:id/disband</code> — <code>{}</code> (disbands guild and frees territories)</li> <li><code>POST /api/guilds/cleanup</code> — <code>{"inactive_days": 14}</code> (audits and dismantles inactive bases)</li> </ul> GET /api/bases &amp; GET /bases <p>Description: Returns all player base camps across the entire world map. Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "count": 2,
  "bases": [
    {
      "base_id": "B1B2B3B4-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "guild_id": "A1B2C3D4-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "location": { "x": 14200.0, "y": 8500.0, "z": 450.0 },
      "worker_count": 15,
      "max_workers": 15
    }
  ]
}
</code></pre></p> GET /api/bases/:id/workers &amp; GET /api/bases/:id/chests <ul> <li><code>GET /api/bases/:id/workers</code>: Assigned base worker Pals (HP, SAN, hunger, debuffs, passives).</li> <li><code>GET /api/bases/:id/chests</code>: Storage chests, slot usage, and item contents.</li> <li><code>POST /api/bases/:id/dismantle</code>: Demolishes the target base camp immediately.</li> </ul>

GET /api/map/entities &amp; GET /map/entities <p>Description: Scans 1,600+ world entities for web maps and companion apps. Query Parameter: <code>?type=all|treasures|deathbags|drops|wildbuilds|chests|supplies</code> Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "count": 1670,
  "entities": [
    {
      "id": "E73CBD32-41BE801A-8092778D-30D5DE15",
      "type": "treasure",
      "sub_type": "Grade_2",
      "name": "TreasureBox_Electric",
      "location": { "x": 87129.0, "y": 343851.5, "z": 7675.6 },
      "is_opened": false
    }
  ]
}
</code></pre></p> World Cleaners &amp; Bag Recovery <ul> <li><code>POST /api/map/cleardrops</code> — <code>{"radius": 0}</code> (<code>0</code> cleans world-wide loose items)</li> <li><code>POST /api/map/clearwildbuilds</code> — <code>{"radius": 0, "unowned_only": true}</code> (demolishes wilderness structures)</li> <li><code>POST /api/map/recoverbag</code> — <code>{"player": "PalTrainer"}</code> (recovers lost death bag directly into player inventory)</li> <li><code>POST /api/map/triggersupply</code> — <code>{"meteor": true}</code> (forces instant supply capsule or meteorite impact)</li> </ul>

GET /api/janitor/status <p>Description: Inspect background maintenance worker status, sweep intervals, and lifetime cleanup telemetry. Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "enabled": true,
  "running": true,
  "config": {
    "drops_interval_sec": 600,
    "wild_builds_interval_sec": 1800,
    "auto_save_interval_sec": 300
  },
  "stats": {
    "total_drops_cleared": 142,
    "total_wild_builds_cleared": 8,
    "total_auto_saves": 24
  }
}
</code></pre></p> POST /api/janitor/run &amp; POST /api/janitor/config <ul> <li><code>POST /api/janitor/run</code>: <code>{"clean_drops": true, "clean_wild_builds": true, "force_save": true}</code> triggers an immediate maintenance sweep.</li> <li><code>POST /api/janitor/config</code>: Dynamically adjusts interval timers at runtime.</li> </ul>

GET /violations <p>Description: Returns all detected security violations recorded by the native heuristics engine (SpeedHack, Teleport, FlyHack, InventoryAnomalies). Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "count": 1,
  "violations": [
    {
      "player": "SpeedyCheater",
      "steam_id": "76561198000000000",
      "rule": "SpeedHack",
      "action_taken": "Kick",
      "details": "Moved 8450 units in 0.2s (threshold: 3000)",
      "timestamp": 1725639000
    }
  ]
}
</code></pre></p>

POST /admin/command &amp; POST /v1/api/command <p>Description: Executes any in-game chat slash command directly via the REST API with full textual feedback. Request Body: <pre><code>{
  "command": "/janitor status"
}
</code></pre> Response <code>200 OK</code>: <pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "command": "/janitor status",
  "response": "[Janitor] Status: Active (Running: Yes) | Cleaned Drops: 142 | Cleaned Builds: 8"
}
</code></pre></p> Official PalServer v1 API Endpoints <p>Drop-in compatibility with official PalServer tooling and web panels:</p> Method Endpoint Description <code>GET</code> <code>/v1/api/info</code> Server version, server name, and engine details <code>GET</code> <code>/v1/api/players</code> List active online players <code>POST</code> <code>/v1/api/announce</code> Broadcast banner message (<code>{"message": "..."}</code>) <code>POST</code> <code>/v1/api/kick</code> Kick player (<code>{"userid": "...", "message": "..."}</code>) <code>POST</code> <code>/v1/api/ban</code> Ban player (<code>{"userid": "...", "message": "..."}</code>) <code>POST</code> <code>/v1/api/unban</code> Unban player (<code>{"userid": "..."}</code>) <code>POST</code> <code>/v1/api/save</code> Force immediate world save to disk <code>POST</code> <code>/v1/api/shutdown</code> Graceful server shutdown (<code>{"seconds": 60, "message": "..."}</code>)
